From 7766242773c700ce392adc7326c206459ffecfa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bkurmanbek <bakytzhan.kurmanbek@nu.edu.kz>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:15:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf: pipeline /infer_stream stages + output-space composite

prep/gpu/composite run as concurrent coroutines (bounded queues, in-order,
abort-on-disconnect preserved in gpu stage + synchronous task cancel in finally);
composite directly in 540x960 output space using precomputed bg540/crop328.
~2x server throughput (65 -> ~128 fps), SSIM 0.999 vs full-res. All flag-gated
with defaults preserving original behaviour: SYNCTALK_PIPELINE, SYNCTALK_FAST_COMPOSITE,
SYNCTALK_DTYPE, SYNCTALK_PROFILE, SYNCTALK_GPU_JPEG. Adds bench_forward.py
(GPU-only forward microbench).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
